{%- comment -%}
  Klapklaar wordmark, inline (brand v4 §3.4 + §12): brand/svg/logo-inline.svg (desktop) and
  brand/svg/logo-klein-inline.svg (below 750 px, the drawing for 97–148 px). Letters are currentColor and follow the
  colour scheme's text colour; the tent has class "kk-tent" and is filled with var(--logo-tent): Klaproos on light
  schemes, Polder on Zakelijk pages, Zon on Polder/Inkt (set per colour scheme, see snippets/css-variables.liquid).
  Never logo-mono in the header. With settings.logo_tent_mono the tent takes the letter colour.
  Params: class (string), title (string, defaults to shop name), image (bool: honour settings.logo upload),
          variant: 'auto' (both drawings, CSS switches at 750 px), 'full' or 'klein'
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign logo_variant = variant | default: 'full' -%}
{%- if image and settings.logo != blank -%}
  {%- capture logo_sizes -%}(min-width: 750px) {{ settings.logo_width }}px, {{ settings.logo_width_mobile }}px{%- endcapture -%}
  {{- settings.logo | image_url: width: 600 | image_tag: class: 'logo-img', alt: shop.name, widths: '150, 225, 300, 450, 600', sizes: logo_sizes, loading: 'eager' -}}
{%- else -%}
  {%- assign logo_label = title | default: shop.name | escape -%}
